00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.497
It was the way she spoke.

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:32.532
I will never be able to shake that voice.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.833
And the desperate cries for help

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.035
out of my mind

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.403
